<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">Ephesi Mozy</book>
  <para style="h">Ephesi Mozy</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ephesi Mozy</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ephesi Mozy</para>
  <para style="mt">Ephesi Mozy</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pawla, Khazohpa khozie hawhta Krista Zisu lyuhchâpa ta Ephesi khih liata mopathaihpazy nata Krista Zisu liata ngâchhihpazy ei châ naoh ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khazohpa eima Paw nata Abeipa Zisu Krista tawhta ngiachhiena nata thlalôhna nama hnohta y mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khazohpa nata eima Beipa Zisu Krista Paw cha reithaipa ta y mawh sy. Ano chata avâ suzy liana khita Krista zawhzi ta thlahpa lâ byhnâ to miah pie ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hmiakô liata pathaihpa nata seina hnei leipa ta eima y thei nawpa ta, leilô y hlâ tawhta Krista liata miah a tlyh ta. Kyhpachâna ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />ano khozie nata â lyzie hawhta, Zisu Krista liata a sawzy ta tao awpa ta miah a vaw rao chhielie haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A ngiachhiena rônahzie reithai awpa ta, saw châna cha a Kyhpachâpa liata a saipa ta miah a pie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A thisaih vâta ano liata chatlaina hnei pi ta, cha cha a ngiachhiena hneirôhzie lymâ hawhta, eima paraonazy angiahthaina a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cha ngiachhiena vâna chata sona nata novâhna to ta miah a vaohei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hmochhuahpa bienyupa cha, â chhuahpa hawh tlai ta Krista liata a vaw patlôsapa kyh miah a pahnosa haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chatanachata daihti â ki tita, hmo to, avâ liata a ypa nata alei liata a ypa zydua, Krista liata syhpahmaoh khaipa a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keimo cha Khazohpa ryhraopa hawhta rao chhieliepazy châ pi ta, Krista liata Khazohpa ryutozy eima châ. Ano ta a khozie hawhta ryhrao ta, hmo to a tao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chatanachata keimo, Krista liata hnabeiseihna a hnei tuapazy pi he a rônahna reithaina eima châ thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nâmo chhao, nama pachhana thâtihpha biehmeiseihpa thei ei chi ta, namâ ngiapâ ha tawhta cha, ano liana chata bietai Thlahpa Pathaihpa ta pa-ipa nama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ano cha Khazohpa rônahna reithai nawpa ta, Khazohpa ta a ryutozy a chatlai hlâ chhao ta, cha ryuto cha eima hmô tlai aw tahpa pa-ina sôhkâ a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cha vâna chata, Abeipa Zisu liata namâ ngiapâna nata mopathaihpa zydua chô liata nama kyhpachâna zy ei vaw thei nahta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />ei thlahchhânazy liata nama moh reipa ta, nâmo châta alyna bie rei bâh va na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Krista nama pahno pasia thei nawpa ta, eima Beipa Zisu Krista Khazohpa, rônahna Paw ta sona nata aluahna Thlahpa a cha pie awpa ei ta thlah ei cha chhâpa ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Awpa nama châna liata hnabeiseihna pahnopa ta, mopathaihpazy châta a ryuto rônahpa hluhzie nama pahno thei nawpa ta, nama pathipalôh mozy pavâsapa a châ thei nawpa ta thlah ei cha chhâpa hra ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chatanachata a thatlôna rônahpa raihriazie hawhta, keimo ngiapâtuhpazy chô liata a hmotaotheina rônah ngaitapa cha, khâpa ma a châ tahpa nama pahno thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Cha hmotaotheina cha athihpa hry tawhta Krista a pathyu nota nata avâ suzy liata a chachâh lâta a patyusa nota, Krista liata a hriatuhpa hmotaotheina a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cha hmotaotheina cha, abeina zydua, biehneina zydua, hmotaotheina zydua nata ryureina zydua chô lâta y ta, he khizaw lia dei châ leipa ta, khizaw vaw y awpa liata chhao, moh bipa to chô lâta a y aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khazohpa ta hmo to zydua Krista phei ry liata soh ta, hmo to chô liata luh châ awpa ta, Krista cha Awnanopa hnohta a pie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Awnanopa cha Krista pôhpa châ ta, ato pakituhpa pakina a châ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nâmo chhao paraona nata moleinazy vâta athipa nama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />He khizaw ryhpa hawhta y ei chi ta, avâ ruapa liata ryureituhpa bei, reingiah leipazy chô liata tahmâ chhao a hria haipa thlahpa cha pazipa ta, paraona nata moleinazy liata nama vaw tlaih tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keimo chhao eikhano cha, reingiah leipazy hry liata eima vaw y hra. Eima sapa aohraohnazy papitlohsapa ta, sapa nata palôh khopazy vaw tao tyh pi ta, chyhsa hropazy hawhta hiehâhna saw ta a vaw pihpa eima châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Châhrasala ngiachhiena a hnei hluhpa Khazohpa ta kyhpachâna rônahpa ta kyh miah pachâ ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />eima paraonazy vâta athipa eima châ no tlai chhao ta, Krista hnohta miah a pahro haw. Ngiachhiena ta pachhapa nama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Krista Zisu hnohta miah pathyu ta, avâ suzy liata ano hnohta miah a patyusa haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chatanachata daihti vaw tlô awpazy liata, Krista liana chata Khazohpa ta eima chô liata a phana palâsa aw ta, panua tiah leipa a ngiachhiena hluhpi eima chô lia a palâsa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngiachhiena vâta ngiapâna ta pachhapa nama châ. Cha chhao cha nâmo tawhta a puapa châ leipa ta, Khazohpa hmosaipiepa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hmotaopa vâta châ vei, chataleipatala chyhsa ta â palaikhei pathlei aw na.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hmo pha tao awpa ta, Khazohpa ta Krista Zisu liata miah a tao. Cha hmo pha tao awpa cha, eima chânazie awpa ta Khazohpa ta â vaw chhuanoh chhieliepa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chavâta he he a thei thlâh ha teh u. Hlâno ta cha, nâmo, sapa liata Zenitaizy cha chopawtaipazy ta, “Chopawtaileipa” ama cha tah tyh. Chopawtaipa cha pôhpa liata ku ta taopa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kha nona kha, Krista a hlao leipa ta y ei chi ta, Izarei râh nata a maniahpa ta, bietai biehraizy liata khichhaipa châpa ta, hnabeiseihna hnei leipa nata Khazohpa hnei leipa ta khizaw liata nama y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tahmâ Krista Zisu liata deikua cha, nâmo, eikhano ta lâhlapi ta a y tyhpazy kha, Krista thisaih ta pahniasapa ta nama y haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ano cha eimâ ryhna châ ta, py nozy cha pôhkha ta miah taopa ta, akhakhaina nata apachhaihna pâhchhô cha a sapa ta parao ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ryhpa biepiepa nata bieraopazy pahlei ta, panozy cha ano liata chyhsa thiehpa pôhkha pachâsapa ta, aryhna a tao haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kraws zawhzi ta panozy cha pôhpa miakha châpa ta, Khazohpa nata miah paryhsa ta, chatanachata akhakhaina cha a thie haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Krista â vy nona khata, nâmo, lâhlapi ta a ypazy hnohta aryhna bie cha chho ei ta, lâhnia liata a ypazy hnohta chhao a cha chho hra ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ano siepahliepa ta Thlahpa miakha ta Paw a hnia theina eima py no ta eima hnei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chavâta tahmâ la khichhaipa nata khitlyhpa dei châ khao veih ei chi. Mopathaihpazy nata hmaohkha ta khinarâh sawzy châ ha ei chi ta, Khazohpa chhôhkhazy tlao nama châ haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Krista Zisu cha a ki liata alô peimawh chaipa châ ta, lyuhchâpazy nata hrohsopazy lôbôpa chô liata sapa nama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ano liana chata o sana lôzy paryhpa châ ta, Abeipa liata Achhyna o pathaihpa a vaw châ tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ano liana chata nâmo chhao Khazohpa pahrâ nawpa ta paryh pakhypa châ ei chi ta, cha liata Khazohpa cha Thlahpa ta a pahrâ.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cha vâna chata kei, Pawla, nâmo Zenitaizy châta Krista Zisu vâta atâhpa heta ei cha chho ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khazohpa ta nâmo châta ngiachhie chakaona raihria eina piepa kyh nama vaw pahno ha aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aluahna ta bienyupa pahnosapa ei châpa kyh a chyuta ei vaw roh ha khawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kha châpaphaopa kha nama reih khiahta cha, Krista bienyupa ei pahnozie nama pahno thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cha thâtihpha bienyupa cha, tahmâ nota a lyuhchâpa pathaihpazy nata a hrohsopa pathaihpazy hnohta Thlahpa ta a pahnosapa hawhna heta, kha hlâta chyhsa sawzy hnohta pahnosapa châ beih vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bienyupa cha he he a châ: Thâtihpha vâta Zenitaizy cha, Krista Zisu liata Izarei sawzy nata ryuto lâhpazy châ ei ta, pôhpa miakha pachiahpa a châ khohpazy nata bietai a hlypazy ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khazohpa ngiachhiena hmosaipiepa vâta, cha thâtihpha chakaotuhpa ta taopa châ na ta, cha chakaona rai cha a hmotaotheina hmâpa ta ei hnohta eina pie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mopathaihpa chyh chaipa hlâta chyh viapa châ hraw sah la, pahno khai thei leipa Krista hneirôna cha, Zenitaizy hnohta chho awpa ta, cha ngiachhiena cha piepa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khazohpa ato taotuhpa hnohta nyu kôzawpa bienyupa achhuahna cha palâsa awpa ta, cha ngiachhiena cha piepa ei châ hra.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chatanachata Khazohpa sona hnei hluhzie cha, avâ suzy liata ryureihtuhpazy nata biehneituhpazy hnohta, Awnanopa hmâpa ta pahnosapa ta a y thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cha cha Khazohpa chhâzaw hmochhuahpa châ ta, eima Beipa Krista Zisu liata a vaw patlôsa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Krista eimâ ngiapâpa vâta, riahphapa nata ngâhna chôta Khazohpa eima hnia thei haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chavâta nama châta pasa ei taopa vâta hnabeidy lei awpa ta ei châ haw ei. Nama rônah nawpa ta pasa ei taopa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cha vâna chata Paw hmiakô liata pakhu paneihpa ta ei bôh tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ano cha lei nah vâ liata chhôhkha to moh bi hnâpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A rônahna hneirôh ngaitazie hawhta, Khazohpa ta a Thlahpa zawhzi ta nama chhôh lâ hro tha a cha patlô thei nawpa ei ta, thlah ei cha chhâpa ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chatanachata Krista cha ngiapâna vâta nama palôhzy liata pahrâ aw ta, a kyhpachâna liata thari thlapa nata abôna hneipa ta y thei aw ei chi ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />mopathaihpa zydua chhaota Khazohpa kyhpachâna kawhzie, seihzie, asâhzie nata athuzie zy nama pahno thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Novâhna hlâta a sâh viapa Krista kyhpachâna pahno aw ei chi ta, Khazohpa pakina ta pabiepa nama châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tahmâ keimo liata a hria tyhpa hmotaotheina lymâ hawhta, eima hiapa nata pachâpa zydua hlâta tha via syulyu ta a tao theituhpa Khazohpa hnohta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Awnanopa liata nata Krista Zisu liata rônahna cha, chhâ zydua hnohta chhâzaw nata tlyzaw ta y mawh sy. Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chavâta a cha awna ei nata â phuhpa ta y awpa ta, kei Abeipa châta atâhpa heta ei châ haw ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tlokhuh apanawhna, areisina nata daotheina zy hneipa ta, kyhpachâna ta a chhyh thai raihrie u la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thlahpa apôhkhana a y lymâ thei nawpa ta, adyhna ta a chahrypa ta tei lymâ teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pôhpa miakha nata Thlahpa pakha dei y ta, cha hawhna chata, awpa nama châ nona kha, hnabeiseihna miakha hnei awpa ta awpa nama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Abeipa pakha, ngiapâna miakha, bâtina miakha nata
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khazohpa pakha deita a y. Ano cha ato Paw châ ta, ato chô liata y ta, ato chahryh khai ta, ato chhôh liata a y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Châhrasala Krista ta hmosaipiepa a rainazie lymâ hawhta, ngiachhiena cha a saipa ta pie chyupa eima châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chavâta, “Chô lâ a khy nota, Seichâna cha sei ta a chhi ta, Chyhsazy hnohta Hmosaipiepazy a pie ei,” tahpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“A kkhy,” tahpa heta, alei su a hnaipa lâ a za chô tuana a palâsapa châ vei ma?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A zâ chôpa tlai kha, avâ zydua chô lâ a khypa cha châ ta, lei nata vâ cha ano ta a bie khai haw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chatanachata thokha lyuhchâpa châ awpa ta, thokha hrohsopa châ awpa ta, thokha biechhotuhpa châ awpa ta, thokha mietaku vaituhpa châ awpa nata thokha pachutuhpa châ awpa ta Krista ta a rao ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chazy cha chakaona rai hria awpa ta mopathaihpazy pachhuahpanoh ta, Krista pôhpa pipatlohsa nawpa ta piepa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eima zydua ta ngiapâna nata Khazohpa Sawchapawpa pahnona liata pôhkha châpa ta, pitlohna hro hneipa ta, Krista pakina tlu ta pakipa ta eima y thei nawpa ta piepa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chatanachata chyhsa so piehpiena nata dôthaina hmotaopa tichatlaopazy ta hao lâ he lâ a chatlaopa nata pachuna ziza to ta a phao pahaipa hawtipa châ khao aw ma pi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kyhpachâna ta biedopa reipa ta, kyh to liata ano liata eima laiseih lymâ aw. Ano cha luh châ ta, cha cha Krista a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ano liana chata pôhpa pachiahpa to a pazaopakhypa ta, pachiahpa to ta ama raihria chyu a phapa ta ama hria nahta, pôhpa cha kyhpachâna liata a laiseih tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />He he Abeipa liata reih na ta, ei cha chho ei: Pachâna hraoleipa a hneipa Zenitaizy hawhta nama y khao awpa châ vei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama palôh kuhchhapa vâta pahno leina âmo liata y ta, cha chata ama pahnona pazohsa ta, Khazohpa hrona tawhta pachhaihpa ta ama y.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nozana châh chhao pahno khao leipa ei ta, parâna liata âmosasyh a hlâ ei ta, karây ngaitapa ta hmo puapa to ama tao.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nâmo deikua cha, cha hawhta Krista cha a chu veih ei chi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A thâtih thei ei chi ta, Zisu liata biehmeiseihpa a ypa hawhta, ano liata pachupa nama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eikhano ta nama hrozie ta a hrohpa, dôveina piehpie aohraohna ta a parao tyhpa, nama chyhsa parohpa kha pahluh u la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />nama palôh pachânazy pathiehpa ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />siana nata pathaihna hmeiseihpa liata Khazohpa lyupa ta taopa chyhsa thiehpa ta a tobi teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Chavâta haipa bâhsai u la, nama vaih hnohta biedopa reih chyu teh u. Pôhpa miakha tawhta a pachiahpa sai eima châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nama hiehâh sala, molei deikua molei khuh vy. Nama hiehâhna cha noh ta tlakhei leipa sala,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />ahripa châta su paruapa khuh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A paru tyhpa ta paru khao leipa sala, phahlapazy pie awpa a hnei thei nawpa ta, ano ku ta hmo phapa hria sala, hriapasa mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Bie pha leipa rai nama pakah tawhta pua khah sy. Chyhsa taopathi nawpa bie deita, a daihti nata su a hmiepa ta, nama pakah tawhta pua mawh sy. Chatanachata a theituhpazy châta ngiachhiena ama tona a châ aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Khazohpa Thlahpa Pathaihpa pachâ parôh khuh vy, chatlaina noh châta ano ta ngiapa nama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ruchhôna, pathiiana, hiehâhna, paphôhna nata reipachhiena zydua nâmo tawhta thy khai teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A ngiachhie raihriepa ta, tha a pasa raihrie u la, Khazohpa ta Krista liata a châ ngiahthaipa hawh ei ta, a ngiahthai raihrie teh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chavâta Khazohpa kyhpachâpa sawzy nama châpa hawhta, a hâ a latuhpazy châ teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Krista ta kyh miah pachâ ta, ropahâhpa châta Khazohpa lâta hmohlâpa ta nata atheihna ta keimo châta â piepa hawhna khata, kyhpachâna hro ta nâmo chhao hroh teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mopathaihpazy nama châ tawhta cha, apatlana, puana zydua nata uahvana zy nama hry liata a rei chhao reipa châ khah sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bie puapa reipa zy, bie hrupa reipa zy, saiso pathaih leipa bie reipa zy a ngia vei. Chazy taopa hlâta cha alyna bie tlao reih tyh muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />He he a siapa ta pahno teh u: Apatlana moleina a taopa tlyma, chyhsa puapa tlyma, uahvana a hneipa tlyma, cha hawhpa chyhsazy chata Krista nata Khazohpa khinarâh liata ryu to hnei aw veih ei. Uahvana a hneipa cha nothlahpa achhypa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahy hmahta hraoleipa bie ta cha dôvei khah ei sy. Cha hmozy vâna chata Khazohpa pathiiana cha ngiapâleipa sawzy chô liata a tlô tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chavâta âmo cha a hlykhei khuh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hlâno cha zohpa châ ei chi ta, tahmâ deikua, Abeipa liata khaihpa nama vaw châ haw. Khaihpa sawzy hawhta hroh teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khaihna theilâpa cha phana nata siana nata biehmeiseihpa to liata â lâ tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Abeipa khopa khâpa ma a châ tahpa pahnopasia a chhuah teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zohna hmotaopa a pathei beih leipazy liata a hlao leipa u la, zohna hmotaopazy cha tlao palâhâh teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Arulâta ama tao tyhpazy cha, reipa chhao ta nozachhihpa hmo a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Châhrasala hmo kheihawhpa rai, khaihpa ta a palâsa tita cha, hmô theipa ta a y tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hmô theipa ta a ypa maih cha khaihpa a châ. Chavâta, “Nâ, a môpa, a hra la, Athihpa hry tawhta thyu teh! Krista ta a cha khaipahlie aw,” tahpa a châpa kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chatanachata asoleipazy hawhta y leipa u la, asopazy hawhta ypa ta, nama yzie liata a chado teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nohzy he a pha leipa vâta, daihti rypaohpa patu thai teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chavâta hru leipa u la, Abeipa khopa khâpa ma a châ tahpa tlao pahno teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kresawhti paripa ta y khah u, parina liata a sohsi leina y tlôh ta, Thlahpa ta biepa ta tlao y teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Reithaina hlazy, Khazohpa hlazy, thlahpa hlazy ta bie a chho raihrie u la, nama pathipalôh ta Abeipa lâ hla sapa ta, totâ tô teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eima Beipa Zisu Krista moh ta, ato liata Paw Khazohpa hnohta alyna bie khâ reih u la,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Krista nama chizana palâsapa ta, a ngiarih raihrie teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lapinô saih u, Abeipa liata namâ ngiarihpa hawhta, nama vahpazy liata a ngiarih teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Krista cha ano pôhpa Awnanopa luh châ ta, Awnanopa pachhatuhpa a châpa hawhta, vahpa cha lapinô luh a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Awnanopa ta Krista liata â ngiarihpa hawhta, lapinôzy chhao ato liata ama vahpazy liata amâ ngiarih awpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vahpa saih u, Krista ta Awnanopa kyhpachâ ta, Awnanopa châta â pie khaipa hawhta, nâmo chhao nama lapinôzy kyhpachâ teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Awnanopa cha bie nata ti ta pasipa ta, a pathaisa thei nawpa ta, Krista cha Awnanopa châta â pie.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chatanachata Awnanopa cha a puapa rai a kiah leipa, a vo a dao leipa nata cha hawhpa hmo rai a phaoh leipa châ thei aw ta, pathaihpa nata seina hnei leipa Awnanopa rônahpa châ awpa ta, Krista ano tlai ta a tao aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Cha hawhna chata, vahpazy ta ama lapinôzy cha âmo pôhpa hawhta pachâpa ta, ama lapinôzy kyh ama pachâ awpa a châ. A lapinô kyh a pachâpa cha anosasyh kyh a pachâpa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahy hmahta ano pôhpa a hao beih vei. Krista ta Awnanopa chyh ta, a mohôhpa hawhta, chyhsa ta a pôhpa cha chyh ta a mohôh tyh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Krista pôhpa pachiahpazy eima châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Chavâta chapaw ta a nô nata paw siesai aw ta, a lapinô a patu aw; chatanachata pôhpa miakha ama vaw châ ha aw.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />He he bienyupa a thu ngaitapa châ ta, châhrasala kei ta la Krista nata Awnanopa thâtih reina a châpa ta ei pahno.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Khâpa rai châ sala, ahy rai ta ano kyh â pachâpa hawhta a lapinô kyhpachâ sala, lapinô chhao ta a vahpa za thai mawh sy.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Saw saih u, Abeipa liata nama nôpawzy rei a ngiah teh u. Cha cha hmo dopa châ tlôh ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Na nô nata na paw palyupalih teh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />na châta pha aw ta, alei liana heta na hro a pareih aw,” tahpa he bietai byhnâ a hneipa biepiepa hmiatuachaipa a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nâmo, pawzy saih u, nama sawzy ru pachhô leipa u la, Abeipa chhoreina nata pachuna liata tlao mohôh teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Seizy saih u, Krista rei namâ ngiapa hawhta, palôh dopa phaopa ta, chipa nata a chalyupa ta, khizaw liata nama zibeipazy rei a ngiah teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chyhsa palysa a chhuahpazy hawhta ama hmô nota dei hria leipa ta, Krista seizy hawhta palôh hmeiseihpa ta Khazohpa khopa tao teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chyhsa chakaopa châ leipa ta, Abeipa chakaopa hawhta pachâpa ta, palôh hmeiseihpa ta chakao muh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sei rai châ sala, khotalaipa rai châ sala, chyhsa to ta hmo phapa ama taopa maih cha, Abeipa tawhta ama hmô heih aw tahpa pahno teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nâmo, zibeipazy saih u, cha hawhna chata nâmo chhao nama seizy chô liata tao hra teh u. Âmo chhao, nâmo chhao, avâ liata zibeipa pakha nama hneipa pahnopa ta, ano liata cha khokhei eih viapa y veih ei tahpa pahnopa ta, nama seizy pachhipary khuh vy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A chhâ chaina ta cha, Abeipa nata a thatlôna liata thatlôpa ta y teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahripa reipasaonazy nama pahnie thei nawpa ta, Khazohpa chariah chhaichhi pakipa ta a tobi teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eimâ piapazy he sapa nata thisaih châ leipa ei ta, abeinazy, biehneinazy, he khizaw zohna chô liata hmotaotheinazy nata avâ suzy liata a ypa thlahpa moleipazy tlao ama châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chavâta noh pha leipa liata namâ dyuh thei nawpa nata nama tao khai tawh chhao ta namâ duah thei nawpa ta, Khazohpa chariah chhaichhi pakipa ta a tobi teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Biehmeiseihpa ta nama chai a saih u la, siana chachôhna vyhphao a kypa ta a duah teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Adyhna thâtihpha châta a mâ chiehpa ta ypa ta, nama phei liata adyhna pheiky a ky teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chazy thota, ngiapâna vyhphao a chaba u la, cha chata moleipa châtai mei zydua nama pachhai thei aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chatawhcha pachhana lakhu a khu u la, Thlahpa zaozi a chaba teh u. Thlahpa zaozi cha Khazohpa bie a châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thlahchhâna nata hiana to ta khatino rai ta Thlahpa ta thlahchhâ teh u. Cha châna chata a hrohrua u la, mopathaihpa zydua châta bâh leipa ta thlahchhâ teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pakah âpa ta thâtihpha bienyupa riahpha ngaitapa ta phuah awpa ta, bie rei awpazy piepa ei châ thei nawpa ta, kei châta na hiapa hra teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thâtihpha ei rei awpa cha riahphapa ta ei rei thei nawpa ta, lyuhchâpa bâlia a kypa ei châ.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Unawh kyhpachâpa nata Abeipa chakaotuhpa ngâchhihpa Tykiku ta hmo to cha chho aw ei ta, kheihta y na ta, khâpa ma ei tao hai tahpazy nama vaw pahno aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eima duahmo vaw pahnopa ta, nama palôh tha a cha patlô thei nawpa ei ta, Tykiku cha nâmo lâ ei vaw tuah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Paw Khazohpa nata Abeipa Zisu Krista tawhta thlalôhna nata ngiapâna a hlaopa kyhpachâna cha, unawhzy hnohta y mawh sy.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kyhpachâna dia beih leipa ta eima Beipa Zisu Krista kyh pachâtuhpa zydua hnohta ngiachhiena y mawh sy.
  </para>
</usx>
